# Splatoon 2 2017/03/24 Proto

@flag offset_shift 0x100

//
// Licensed under GPLv3, see the included LICENSE.txt or visit
// https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html for more information.
//
//      Do not use these patches in an online environment.
//      Even for older versions of the game it's likely you'll be flagged and banned.
//      These patches are solely intended for isolated emuMMC.
//      Consider this your warning!
//
// Special thanks to everyone who has contributed patches to this file.
//

// Fixes an immediate crash on map load when running under emulator.
// Game::CamouflageChecker::calcResult reads back SAMPLES_PASSED occlusion queries
// one frame after submitting them, and asserts GameCamouflageChecker.cpp:93/94
// (mQueryInfo[ cCamouflageType_FriendColor / _EnemyColor ].isBufferEmpty()) when a
// result has not landed yet. Real hardware always completes those queries within the
// ~3-5ms the game allows; emulator's submit/readback path cannot, so the assert
// fires every time. Retail builds compile these asserts out entirely.
// NOPs the two CBNZ branches into cpAssertNoFmt so an unready frame degrades to a
// skipped monitor sample instead of aborting, matching retail behaviour.
//
// Skip CamouflageChecker Asserts [RAMDRAGONS]
@enabled
009C49E8 1F2003D5
009C49F0 1F2003D5
